-thumbnail\" title=\"Hollowing out a baguette.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/db/Hollowing_out_a_baguette..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210122090348\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/db/Hollowing_out_a_baguette..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210122090348 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/db/Hollowing_out_a_baguette..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210122090348 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Hollowing out a baguette.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Hollowing_out_a_baguette..png\" data-image-name=\"Hollowing out a baguette..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_4\" title=\"Series 4\">4</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Lycett\" title=\"Joe Lycett\">Joe Lycett</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Look_at_me.\" title=\"Look at me.\">Look at me.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Friendship_is_truth.\" title=\"Friendship is truth.\">Friendship is truth.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Hollowing out a baguette.</b></i> is the third episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_4\" title=\"Series 4\">Series 4</a> of <i>Taskmaster</i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 9 May 2017. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Lycett\" title=\"Joe Lycett\">Joe Lycett</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Hollowing_out_a_baguette.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Hollowing out a baguette\" was something that <a href=\"/wiki/Hugh_Dennis\" title=\"Hugh Dennis\">Hugh Dennis</a> narrated himself as doing, during the <a href=\"/wiki/Transfer_the_water_from_fishbowl_A_to_fishbowl_B\" title=\"Transfer the water from fishbowl A to fishbowl B\">Transfer the water from fishbowl A to fishbowl B</a> task. The hands made of sausages are a reference to <a href=\"/wiki/Mel_Giedroyc\" title=\"Mel Giedroyc\">Mel Giedroyc</a>'s attempt at the <a href=\"/wiki/Persuade_three_dogs_to_stand_on_the_red_mat\" title=\"Persuade three dogs to stand on the red mat\">Persuade three dogs to stand on the red mat</a> task, where she filled her \"driving gloves\" with chopped up sausages.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Hollowing_out_a_baguette.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Udhulning af en baguette', which translates as 'Hollowing out a baguette'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Hän kovertaa patonkia', which translates as 'He hollows out a baguette'.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Hollowing_out_a_baguette.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Hugh_Dennis\" title=\"Hugh Dennis\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Hugh Dennis</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Lycett\" title=\"Joe Lycett\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Joe Lycett</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Lolly_Adefope\" title=\"Lolly Adefope\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Lolly Adefope</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Mel_Giedroyc\" title=\"Mel Giedroyc\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Mel Giedroyc</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Noel_Fielding\" title=\"Noel Fielding\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Noel Fielding</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Best_membership/subscription\" title=\"Best membership/subscription\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Best membership/subscription.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Camouflage_yourself\" title=\"Camouflage yourself\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Camouflage yourself.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_a_trailer_for_Taskmaster_The_Movie\" title=\"Make a trailer for Taskmaster The Movie\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Make a trailer for Taskmaster The Movie.\n</td>\n<td><b>3</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>3</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Persuade_three_dogs_to_stand_on_the_red_mat\" title=\"Persuade three dogs to stand on the red mat\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Persuade three dogs to stand on the red mat. Exactly 12 legs must be stood on the red mat at the same time.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td>Persuade three chickens to stand on the red mat at the same time.\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"tmtablerow\"><a href=\"/wiki/Transfer_the_water_from_fishbowl_A_to_fishbowl_B\" title=\"Transfer the water from fishbowl A to fishbowl B\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td>Without moving the fishbowls, transfer the water from fishbowl A to fishbowl B. You may only use the items on this table. Also, you must commentate on your attempt throughout the task, always referring to yourself in the third person.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>5\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><small><i><b>Bonus:</b> If you eat any of the chocolate you will be docked five points.</i></small>\n</td>\n<td><small><b>0</b></small>\n</td>\n<td><small>-5</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>DQ</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>-5</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Take_it_in_turns_to_say_a_5-letter_word_whenever_the_music_stops\" title=\"Take it in turns to say a 5-letter word whenever the music stops\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Take it in turns to say a 5-letter word whenever the music stops. You may not say a word that has been previously said. If you fail to say a word before the music starts again, you're eliminated and the game continues with different length words.\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Decant_the_wine_into_another_bottle_from_atop_an_umpire%27s_chair\" title=\"Decant the wine into another bottle from atop an umpire&#39;s chair\">T</a>\n</td>\n<td>Decant the wine into another bottle from atop an umpire's chair.\n</td>\n<td>–\n</td>\n<td><b>✔</b>\n</td>\n<td>–\n</td>\n<td>–\n</td>\n<td>✘\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>15\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">19\n</td>\n<td>12\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>19\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video\">Video</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Video\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" hre